From b734ffa215e1c66cc3b62f7e14ed88864a743949 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 20:16:46 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(hooks): render native Claude/Cursor hooks projecting
 Forge enforcement (988ae187)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Close the Tier-2 parity gap #311 recorded: the capability matrix advertised
native Claude/Codex hooks, but NO renderer wrote any harness-native hook — all
lifecycle enforcement was uniform git hooks (lefthook + check-tdd.js).

- Add lib/hook-renderer.js: maps the Forge hook contract (TDD-gate +
  protected-path intents) to each harness's REAL native hook surface, using
  read -> merge -> write (idempotent, preserves user hooks, backs up unparseable
  configs) — the hook analogue of lib/mcp-config-renderer.js.
    * Claude -> .claude/settings.json  (PreToolUse Write|Edit + Bash groups)
    * Cursor -> .cursor/hooks.json      (v1; beforeShellExecution + afterFileEdit
      — Cursor 1.7 has NO pre-edit deny event, so write-blocking runs on shell)
    * Codex  -> .codex/config.toml [hooks] rendered + tested but NOT written
      (global-config scope per #311); kept for a global-config follow-up.
- Add .forge/hooks/forge-native-hook.js: self-contained enforcement adapter the
  rendered configs invoke — denies protected-path writes and delegates the TDD
  gate to the installed check-tdd.js. Installed into projects by forge setup.
- Wire setupClaudeHooksConfig/setupCursorHooksConfig into forge setup (mirrors
  the MCP renderer wiring); Codex intentionally not wired.
- Flip matrix hooks rows: claude+cursor -> native/delivered; codex stays honest
  (global-config scope). Add sources S11 (Claude hooks) + S12 (Cursor hooks).
- protected-path-manifest: claude protected-path enforcement -> native
  (delivered); Cursor stays fallback (no native pre-edit deny surface).
- Regenerate D20 bd-call-site kill-list (setup.js line-number shift only).

Tests: hook-renderer, setup-hooks-config, forge-native-hook (37 new). bun test
green; ESLint --max-warnings 0; release readiness 0 blockers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
